  "title": "昨日、家族と大阪弁について話をしてたんですけど、まぁ終始爆笑みたいな感じで、関西の人って話し始め「ちゃうねん」から始まるんですね、これは私も同じです。話の終わりは「知らんけど」これもよく使います。つまり大阪弁は関東人には理解するのに時間がかかるのではないかと思います。知らんけど",
  "date": "2018.10.4 04:43",
  "summary": "こんにちは小坂菜緒です遅くなりましたが、横浜の個別握手会ありがとうございました！！1.2.3.5部の参加でした！光飛びすぎ~って全く関係ないよね頭の上に、ちいさな団子が付いてたんですけど見事にきれてました（笑）«1・2部»↑↑↑人生初のダメ...",
  "contentHtml": "\n                      <div><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;.SF UI Text&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69); min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;.SFUIText&quot;; font-size: 15pt;\"></span><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">こんにちは</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">小坂菜緒です</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">遅くなりましたが、横浜の個別握手会ありがとうございました！！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">1.2.3.5部の参加でした！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2018-10-04/26370_0.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_5574.jpeg\"></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">光飛びすぎ~って全く関係ないよね</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">頭の上に、ちいさな団子が付いてたんですけど見事にきれてました（笑）</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">«1・2部»</span></p><p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2018-10-04/26370_1.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_5560.jpeg\"></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">↑↑↑</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">人生初のダメージジーンズを履きました！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">このトップスは私のお気に入りです♪</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">ミニタートルネックが可愛いんですよ✨</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">髪型は1部はポニーテール、2部はハーフアップでした((*&nbsp;॑꒳&nbsp;॑*&nbsp;&nbsp;))</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">まなもちゃんが写ってるのは気にしないでね(&nbsp;¨̮&nbsp;)</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">«3・5部»</span></p><p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2018-10-04/26370_2.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_5586.jpeg\"></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">↑↑↑</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">3部の洋服を撮り忘れてしまいました😭</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">これはシルバーのスカートをパーカーに合わせてます♪腕の部分がチュール素材になっててとても可愛いんです(◦ˉ&nbsp;˘&nbsp;ˉ◦)</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">ちなみに、3部はチェック柄のジャンパースカートをパーカーの中に来てスカートみたいにして着てました！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">髪型は3部はチビ団子、5部は編み込みにしました！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2018-10-04/26370_3.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_5597.jpeg\"></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">編み込み好評やったから嬉しい((*&nbsp;॑꒳&nbsp;॑*&nbsp;&nbsp;))</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2018-10-04/26370_4.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_5656.jpeg\"></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">むーっ</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">頂いたお花</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2018-10-04/26370_5.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_5660.jpeg\"></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">ピンク！！！ハートのバルーン！！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">いつも可愛いお花をありがとう⸜(*˙꒳˙*)⸝</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">次は幕張全握ですね♪♪</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">その前にTGC&nbsp;北九州がありますので、その2日間は楽しみで仕方がないです✨</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px